<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dashboard - Vehicle Accident Detection Alert System</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0d1117;
            --bg-gradient: radial-gradient(circle at top right, #1a2332 0%, #0d1117 100%);
            --surface-color: rgba(22, 27, 34, 0.7);
            --surface-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            --text-primary: #ffffff;
            --text-secondary: #8b949e;
            --accent-blue: #2f81f7;
            --accent-cyan: #39d353;
            --accent-purple: #a371f7;
            --status-critical: #f85149;
            --status-warning: #d29922;
            --status-good: #238636;
            --font-main: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            --glass-bg: rgba(22, 27, 34, 0.4);
            --glass-blur: blur(16px);
            --radius-sm: 8px;
            --radius-md: 12px;
            --radius-lg: 20px;
            --shadow-main: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            --shadow-glow: 0 0 20px rgba(47, 129, 247, 0.4);
            --shadow-glow-critical: 0 0 25px rgba(248, 81, 73, 0.6);
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: var(--font-main);
            background: var(--bg-color);
            background-image: var(--bg-gradient);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        .glass-panel {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
            border: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-main);
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        .app-container { display: flex; width: 100%; height: 100vh; }
        .sidebar {
            width: 280px;
            background: rgba(13, 17, 23, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            z-index: 1000;
        }
        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .brand i { color: var(--status-critical); font-size: 1.8rem; }
        .nav-menu {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }
        .nav-link {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-weight: 500;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .nav-link:hover, .nav-item.active .nav-link {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            background: rgba(47, 129, 247, 0.1);
            box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--accent-blue);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .main-content {
            flex-grow: 1;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        .page-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fff, #8b949e);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .grid-cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }
        .stat-card {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .stat-icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .icon-blue { background: rgba(47, 129, 247, 0.15); color: var(--accent-blue); }
        .icon-green { background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.15); color: var(--status-good); }
        .icon-red { background: rgba(248, 81, 73, 0.15); color: var(--status-critical); }
        .icon-purple { background: rgba(163, 113, 247, 0.15); color: var(--accent-purple); }
        .stat-value { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        .alert-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(248, 81, 73, 0.15) 0%, transparent 100%);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--status-critical);
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .pulsing-dot {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            background-color: var(--status-critical);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: pulse-red 1.5s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse-red {
            0% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(248, 81, 73, 0.7); }
            70% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(248, 81, 73, 0); }
            100% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(248, 81, 73, 0); }
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            background: var(--surface-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            border: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-family: var(--font-main);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--accent-blue);
            color: #fff;
            border-color: var(--accent-blue);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(47, 129, 247, 0.4);
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #1f6feb;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(47, 129, 247, 0.6);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .user-widget {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            background: var(--surface-color);
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            border: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
        }
        .user-avatar {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent-blue);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #fff;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .sidebar { transform: translateX(-100%); position: absolute; height: 100%; }
            .main-content { padding: 1.5rem; }
            .grid-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="app-container">

        <!-- Sidebar Navigation -->
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <div class="brand">
                <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="color: var(--status-critical); font-size: 1.8rem; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px var(--status-critical));">
                    <path d="M18.92 6.01C18.72 5.42 18.16 5 17.5 5h-11c-.66 0-1.21.42-1.42 1.01L3 12v8c0 .55.45 1 1 1h1c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-1h12v1c0 .55.45 1 1 1h1c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-8l-2.08-5.99zM6.5 16c-.83 0-1.5-.67-1.5-1.5S5.67 13 6.5 13s1.5.67 1.5 1.5S7.33 16 6.5 16zm11 0c-.83 0-1.5-.67-1.5-1.5s.67-1.5 1.5-1.5 1.5.67 1.5 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5 1.5zM5 11l1.5-4.5h11L19 11H5z"/>
                </svg>
                <span>SAFE WAY</span>
            </div>

            <ul class="nav-menu">
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a href="/index" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M10 20v-6h4v6h5v-8h3L12 3 2 12h3v8z"/></svg> Home</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a href="/live" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M16 6l2.29 2.29-4.88 4.88-4-4L2 16.59 3.41 18l6-6 4 4 6.3-6.29L22 12V6z"/></svg> Live Sensors</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a href="/location" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zm0 9.5c-1.38 0-2.5-1.12-2.5-2.5s1.12-2.5 2.5-2.5 2.5 1.12 2.5 2.5-1.12 2.5-2.5 2.5z"/></svg> GPS Map</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item critical">
                    <a href="/alert" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M1 21h22L12 2 1 21zm12-3h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2v-4h2v4z"/></svg> Emergency Alerts</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
                    <a href="/about" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M21 5c-1.11-.35-2.33-.5-3.5-.5-1.95 0-4.05.4-5.5 1.5-1.45-1.1-3.55-1.5-5.5-1.5S2.45 4.9 1 6v14.65c0 .25.25.5.5.5.1 0 .15-.05.25-.05C3.1 20.45 5.05 20 6.5 20c1.95 0 4.05.4 5.5 1.5 1.35-.85 3.8-1.5 5.5-1.5 1.65 0 3.35.3 4.75 1.05.1.05.15.05.25.05.25 0 .5-.25.5-.5V6c-.6-.45-1.25-.75-2-1zm0 13.5c-1.1-.35-2.3-.5-3.5-.5-1.7 0-4.15.65-5.5 1.5V8c1.35-.85 3.8-1.5 5.5-1.5 1.2 0 2.4.15 3.5.5v11.5z"/></svg> Project Report</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a href="/contact" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M20 4H4c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L2 18c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 4l-8 5-8-5V6l8 5 8-5v2z"/></svg> Contacts / Admin</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item" style="margin-top: auto;">
                    <a href="/login" class="nav-link"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="font-size: 1.2rem;"><path d="M17 7l-1.41 1.41L18.17 11H8v2h10.17l-2.58 2.58L17 17l5-5zM4 5h8V3H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h8v-2H4V5z"/></svg> Logout</a>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </aside>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <main class="main-content">

            <header class="top-header">
                <div>
                    <h1 class="page-title">Dashboard Overview</h1>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 5px;">Welcome to the Vehicle Accident Detection Alert System</p>
                </div>
                <div class="user-widget">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500;"><%= typeof user !== 'undefined' && user ? user.username : 'Admin' %></span>
                    <div class="user-avatar"><%= typeof user !== 'undefined' && user ? user.username.charAt(0).toUpperCase() : 'A' %></div>
                </div>
            </header>

            <div class="alert-banner" id="systemBanner">
                <div class="pulsing-dot"></div>
                <div>
                    <strong style="display:block; margin-bottom: 2px;">System Live</strong>
                    <span id="system-statusText" style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Active & Monitoring</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Quick Stats -->
            <div class="grid-cards">
                <div class="glass-panel stat-card fade-in" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
                    <div class="stat-icon icon-blue"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18.92 6.01C18.72 5.42 18.16 5 17.5 5h-11c-.66 0-1.21.42-1.42 1.01L3 12v8c0 .55.45 1 1 1h1c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-1h12v1c0 .55.45 1 1 1h1c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-8l-2.08-5.99zM6.5 16c-.83 0-1.5-.67-1.5-1.5S5.67 13 6.5 13s1.5.67 1.5 1.5S7.33 16 6.5 16zm11 0c-.83 0-1.5-.67-1.5-1.5s.67-1.5 1.5-1.5 1.5.67 1.5 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5 1.5zM5 11l1.5-4.5h11L19 11H5z"/></svg></div>
                    <div class="stat-value"><%= typeof stats !== 'undefined' && stats.activeModules ? stats.activeModules : 1 %></div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Active Modules</div>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-panel stat-card fade-in" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
                    <div class="stat-icon icon-green"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z"/></svg></div>
                    <div class="stat-value" style="color: var(--status-good);"><%= typeof stats !== 'undefined' && stats.networkStatus ? stats.networkStatus : 'Online' %></div>
                    <div class="stat-label">GPS & GSM Network</div>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-panel stat-card fade-in" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
                    <div class="stat-icon icon-red"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M19 8h-2v3h-3v2h3v3h2v-3h3v-2h-3zM4 8h8v2H4zM4 13h5v2H4zM4 18h5v2H4z"/></svg></div>
                    <div class="stat-value"><%= typeof stats !== 'undefined' && stats.emergencyContacts ? stats.emergencyContacts : 3 %></div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Emergency Contacts</div>
                </div>

                <div class="glass-panel stat-card fade-in" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
                    <div class="stat-icon icon-purple"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M4 6H2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14v-2H4V6zm16-4H8c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h12c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-1 9h-4v4h-2v-4H9V9h4V5h2v4h4v2z"/></svg></div>
                    <div class="stat-value" style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 10px;"><%= typeof stats !== 'undefined' && stats.cloudStatus ? stats.cloudStatus : 'Connected' %></div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Cloud Firebase</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- System Introduction -->
            <div class="glass-panel fade-in" style="animation-delay: 0.5s; padding: 2.5rem;">
                <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.5rem;">Project Introduction</h2>
                <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem;">
                    The <strong>Vehicle Accident Detection Alert System</strong> uses advanced IoT hardware including an
                    ESP32 microcontroller, MPU-6500 accelerometer sensor, and a GPS/GSM module. By continuously
                    monitoring the G-force exerted on the vehicle, the system instantly identifies collision patterns.
                </p>
                <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1.05rem;">
                    Upon detecting a critical impact, it automatically extracts real-time precise latitude and longitude
                    coordinates and dispatches SMS alerts to pre-configured emergency contacts (Police, Ambulance,
                    Family). Simultaneously, this web dashboard is updated through the cloud, displaying the live map
                    location and sensor diagnostics to expedite rescue operations.
                </p>

                <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem;">
                    <a href="/live" class="btn btn-primary"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M13 2.05v3.03c3.39.49 6 3.39 6 6.92 0 .9-.18 1.75-.48 2.54l2.6 1.53c.56-1.24.88-2.62.88-4.07 0-5.18-3.95-9.45-9-9.95zM12 19c-3.87 0-7-3.13-7-7 0-3.53 2.61-6.43 6-6.92V2.05c-5.06.5-9 4.76-9 9.95 0 5.52 4.47 10 9.99 10 3.31 0 6.24-1.61 8.06-4.09l-2.6-1.53C16.17 17.98 14.21 19 12 19z"/></svg> View Live Sensors</a>
                    <a href="/about" class="btn"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M9 11H7v2h2v-2zm4 0h-2v2h2v-2zm4 0h-2v2h2v-2zm2-7h-1V2h-2v2H8V2H6v2H5c-1.11 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L3 20c0 1.1.89 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 16H5V9h14v11z"/></svg> Hardware Setup</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </main>

    </div>

    <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
